dsh-prompt-booster is based on dsh-prompt-enhance 0.3.2. Files carried over
from it have been modified by Yu Han (2026). The modifications include: boost
modes and the right-click mode menu, the mode editor and host-side mode
storage, per-browser boost-model choice, the light-touch quick boost applied
in place, a fix keeping boost calls out of the conversation, a redesigned UI
on dsh design tokens, and renaming the plugin to prompt-boost /
dsh-prompt-booster. See CHANGELOG.md for details.
